son County","/arc-plc/minnesota/morrison-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 10 grids in Morrison County, February to March and October to November each came in under 90% of normal in 37 of the 75 years from 1951 to 2025. In 2025, October to November ran 67% of normal on the middle. So far in 2026 on the middle, January to February came in at 51% and April to May at 67%. Every grid had its driest year in 1976, with grid 31045 at 47%.</p>"}
